edit('sections/37-transfer-tests.tex',r'Calibration is a measurable deployment choice: its transfer changes target-specific BA and overhead, and uncertainty determines which directions are resolved.',r'Calibration is a measurable deployment choice: changes in target-specific BA and overhead must be compared with local recalibration variability before attributing an effect to model transfer.')
